    }

    // Exports
    // For each export option, write file
    // We need to consider sorting for markup tables: sort affects exported tables for markup formats (Markdown, AsciiDoc, orgmode) per docs.
    // CSV and JSON always input order? CSV earlier seemed input order even with sort mean-time? Actually we tested CSV with sort mean-time and it remained input order? We saw earlier CSV was input order (sleep 0.02 then 0.01) even with mean-time sort? But earlier test with mean-time sorted CSV gave output sorted by input? Let's check again but we saw earlier mean-time CSV still input order? We had test: --sort mean-time --export-csv 'sleep 0.03' 'sleep 0.01' 'sleep 0.02' -> CSV was in input order? Let's see from earlier logs, CSV was in input order (0.03,0.01,0.02) not sorted. So CSV is input order.
    // But markdown etc should be sorted according to sort method.

    // Let's implement export functions

    // Helper to get sorted indices for markup exports
